      'Scoring check: Most spades 2, most cards 1, each Ace 1, 10 of Diamonds (Storan) 2, 2 of Spades (Lillan) 1, last capture (sistan) 1, each tabbe 1. First to 16 points wins. Expected outcome: 16.',
